; ===== MACHINE CLEANUP =====
; Return to home position with Tool 0
T0 ; Select Tool 0 (Brush A)
G0 X0 Y0 F24000
M400 ; Wait for movement to complete
M564 H1 S1 ; Enforce soft limits
; Turn off all airbrush systems
G1 U0.000 F200.0 ; Close Brush A flow
G1 V0.000 F200.0 ; Close Brush B flow
M106 P2 S0 ; Brush A air off
M106 P3 S0 ; Brush B air off
G4 P500 ; Allow air to stop completely
M18 ; Disable all motors
; End of G-code
